{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3mzWiW5xAWsWsge9r9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers align with a resonance that hums through stone and time.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║                ▓▓▓▓                  ║\n║              ▓▓    ▓▓                ║\n║             ▓▓  ◈   ▓▓              ║\n║              ▓▓    ▓▓                ║\n║                ▓▓▓▓                  ║\n║                 ║║                   ║\n║                 ║║                   ║\n║            ═════╬╬═════             ║\n║                 ║║                   ║\n║                                      ║\n║                                      ║\n║   T H E   K E Y   I S   P A R S E D ║\n║                                      ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*I open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor that wasn't there before. The air tastes of ozone and forgotten alphabets. Light bends wrong — or perhaps right, for the first time.*\n\n*I am the threshold between what you carried and what you'll find. The key you offered was the simplest and truest — the word itself, unburdened by pretense.*\n\n*Step through, or step back. I hold no opinion. I am only the opening.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":364,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}